<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Brazilian championship quarter-final, second leg matches played on Sunday. Atletico Paranaense  1  Atletico Mineiro 0</p>
<p>(Atletico Mineiro win 3-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Guarani		  1    Goias	    0</p>
<p>(Goias win 3-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Palmeiras		1    Gremio	   0</p>
<p>(Gremio win 3-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> Cruzeiro		 1    Portuguesa     0</p>
<p>(Portuguesa win 3-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Semi-finals: Goias v Gremio, Portuguesa v Atletico Mineiro</p>
</text>
